.vscode/

# The build counter (the "build #N" the viewer page states) moved to
# src/build_n.txt and IS tracked, on purpose: it is an all-time running
# count carried from v1, and the build resets it to 1 when the file is
# missing — so a fresh clone would lose the count if it were ignored.
# The cost is one churning line per build in the diff. The old
# tools/build_counter.txt is gone.
